ction elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-954af24 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"954af24\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e044da0\" data-id=\"e044da0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1ec70d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d1ec70d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Simplify Living is guided by the KonMari method, which serves as our framework. Of course, personal and individual aspects are always taken into account to create authentic and sustainable solutions.<\/p><p>The KonMari Method is a tidying approach developed by Marie Kondo to help you create your ideal, personalized living space. It guides you to thoroughly and completely organize your home. At the heart of the method is what\u2019s called \u2018Joy Checking\u2019: you keep only what you truly need or what brings you joy, and let go of the rest. This creates more space for what really matters to you, while releasing anything that brings unpleasant feelings. Sounds good, doesn\u2019t it<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a2797ce elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a2797ce\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-col