t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The process is simple and structured. We start with a free, no-obligation consultation to review your current situation, your goals, and any other important factors. Next, you sort your belongings category by category, keeping only what truly sparks joy. This ongoing process helps you gain clarity about what you want \u2014 and don\u2019t want \u2014 in your home and life. In the end, we establish an organizational system that fits perfectly with what you choose to keep.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4356fa1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4356fa1\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c79c078\" data-id=\"c79c078\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-23ffd94 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"23ffd94\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-25 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8ffce79\" data-id=\"8ffce79\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7240866 elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"7240866\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-