\t<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>methode Wie schafft man langfristig Ordnung? Simplify Living orientiert sich an der KonMari-Methode. Diese dient als roter Faden. Selbstverst\u00e4ndlich werden pers\u00f6nliche und individuelle Aspekte immer miteinbezogen, um authentische und nachhaltige L\u00f6sungen anzubieten. Die KonMari-Methode ist eine Aufr\u00e4ummethode, die von Marie Kondo entwickelt wurde, um ein individuelles, ideales Wohnen zu erm\u00f6glichen. Damit r\u00e4umst du dein Zuhause &hellip;<\/p>\n<p class=\"read-more\"> <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/method\/\"> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Method<\/span> Read More &raquo;<\/a><\/p>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"enabled","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1521","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1521","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/simplify-living.ch\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1521"}],"versi